  "description": "Add the DBestChatBot AI assistant to your Umbraco site. It answers visitors 24/7 from your own content and data, captures leads and books appointments. Install the package, add your site token to appsettings.json and deploy: which chatbot shows on which pages, and what it learns from your site, is then managed from the DBestChatBot dashboard. Read-only, never writes to your database.",
