  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0: per-page control. Site owners can block pages in appsettings.json (DBestChatBot:ExcludedPaths), editors can tick a \"hideChatbot\" true/false property to hide the chat on a page and everything below it, and the dashboard can switch the chat off for sections. 1.1.0: adds Umbraco 10, 11, 12 and 13 (net6.0 build) alongside Umbraco 17+. 1.0.0: first release. Chat widget on public pages (assigned per path from the dashboard), read-only sync of the published page tree and chosen tables, built-in blocking of personal-data columns.",
